+target date, not business days. The centre is the last print plus that many times the mean of the
+last 12 print-to-print changes. The width per print blends the sd of the last 36 changes (weight
+0.75) with the sd of the last 240. The shape is a smoothed bootstrap of recent standardised changes.
+
+| asset | last print | drift per print | sd per print | horizon:prints |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
